@startuml
title A1 - Dopolnitev prijave

actor "Uporabnik" as User
boundary "PregledSkupineMaska" as UI
control "PrijaveKontroler" as Controller
entity "Prijave" as Reports

User -> UI: izbere uporabnika in prijavi vedenje
activate UI

UI -> Controller: odpriObrazecZaPrijavo(...)
activate Controller
Controller --> UI: obrazec
deactivate Controller

User -> UI: vnese opis in odda prijavo

UI -> Controller: oddajPrijavo(...)
activate Controller

Controller -> Reports: shraniPrijavo(...)
activate Reports
Reports --> Controller: prijavaShranjena
deactivate Reports

Controller --> UI: potrditevPrejema
deactivate Controller

UI --> User: prikaz potrditve

== Dopolnitev prijave ==

User -> UI: odpre obstoječo prijavo
User -> UI: dopolni opis

UI -> Controller: posodobiPrijavo(prijavaId, novOpis)
activate Controller

Controller -> Reports: posodobiPrijavo(...)
activate Reports
Reports --> Controller: spremembaShranjena
deactivate Reports

Controller --> UI: uspeh
deactivate Controller

UI --> User: prikaz posodobljene prijave
deactivate UI
@enduml